00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:49.523
Looking at it.

00:01:49.523 --> 00:01:51.083
But it's so slow.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.690
I think I might have cooked it for too long.

00:01:54.690 --> 00:01:56.557
It's 277, I don't know if we're screwed.

00:01:56.557 --> 00:01:59.193
I'm gonna pour this into this silicon mold.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:00.603
Oh my god.

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:04.433
Okay.

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:06.200
Oh that was not a good idea.

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:08.140
We're going to let it cool down for a little bit.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.210
We are back in business.

00:02:11.210 --> 00:02:13.820
The cornstarch is to keep it from sticking together.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.653
Here we go.

00:02:14.653 --> 00:02:15.486
